    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0699" n="597" xml:id="pg597"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/120: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Geneva</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gilbert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-01-16T10:00:00+01:00">January 16,
                            1935—10 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 16—6:09 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>21. Consulate’s 19, January 15, 4 p.m. Late last evening Abyssinian delegate
                    handed to the Secretary General an appeal to the Council<anchor n="5"
                        xml:id="d468-f1"/> under article XI, paragraph 2, of the Covenant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gilbert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d468-f1" n="5" xml:id="d468-f1-content">
                <p>See League of Nations, <hi rendition="#italic">Official Journal</hi>, February
                    1935, pp. 252–258.</p>
            </note>
